+            )
+            Text(
+                text = "Everything she knows is stored only on this phone. A model that runs somewhere else still has to be sent what a reply needs: the conversation, her character card and her notes. Two ways to keep even that from the company hosting the model: a model id starting with e2ee- (encrypted on this phone, readable only inside a sealed enclave), or a model running on this phone or your own computer (On-Device AI, Ollama).",
+                fontSize = 10.sp,
